<p>Summons a clone for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 5, 5</acronym> turns which casts all the spells you cast, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">33%, 51%, 62%, 69%, 74%</acronym> damage and having 50% health. Additionally, all light damage the clone deals becomes darkness damage and all darkness damage becomes light damage.</p>